{"ref":"BDB, קַ֫יִן³","hw":"קַ֫יִן³","html":"† III. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קַ֫יִן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. Cain</strong>, Καιν, eldest son of Adam and Eve <strong>(</strong>expl. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:1\" href=\"/Genesis.4.1\">Gn 4:1</a> from <span dir=\"rtl\">קָנָה</span> <em>acquire;</em> but in fact = ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span>, as <em>heros eponymos</em>, according to We<sup>Comp. 11</sup> Sta<sup>G 285 ff.</sup> Bu<sup>Urg. 193</sup> Holz <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50\" href=\"/Genesis.50\">Gn 50 f.</a> especially Sta<sup>ZAW xiv (1894), 250 ff.; xv (1895), 157 ff.</sup>, Che<sup>Ency. Bib. cain</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:1\" href=\"/Genesis.4.1\">Gn 4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:2\" href=\"/Genesis.4.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:3\" href=\"/Genesis.4.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:5\" href=\"/Genesis.4.5\">5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:8\" href=\"/Genesis.4.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:9\" href=\"/Genesis.4.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:13\" href=\"/Genesis.4.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:15\" href=\"/Genesis.4.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:16\" href=\"/Genesis.4.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:17\" href=\"/Genesis.4.17\">17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָ֑יִן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:6\" href=\"/Genesis.4.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:24\" href=\"/Genesis.4.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:25\" href=\"/Genesis.4.25\">25</a> (all J).","next":"BDB, קֵינִי","prev":"BDB, קִינָה"}